---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Pricing - Free with Ads" seo={{ page_description: "UConvertDocument is completely free to use. We monetize through non-intrusive ads." }}>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 prose">
    <h1>Pricing</h1>
    <p>UConvertDocument is <strong>100% free to use</strong>.</p>
    <h2>How is it free?</h2>
    <p>We monetize our service through non-intrusive advertisements. This allows us to cover our server and development costs while keeping the tool completely free for our users.</p>
    <h2>What do you get for free?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Unlimited format conversions</li>
      <li>Access to all tools (PDF to Word, Merge PDF, JPG to PDF, etc.)</li>
      <li>No watermarks on your documents</li>
      <li>Fast processing times</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>
